590
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:50,560
employer did.

591
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:52,520
You break into the networks of foreign

592
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:54,320
governments and companies. You steal

593
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:55,360
secrets for a flag instead of for a

594
