647
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:35,520
You got everything that kid wanted.

648
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:37,320
You got it by becoming something he

649
00:21:35,520 --> 00:21:39,280
would not recognize.

650
00:21:37,320 --> 00:21:41,120
You are 40 and you are the most capable

651
00:21:39,280 --> 00:21:42,760
ghost in the room.

652
00:21:41,120 --> 00:21:44,080
Some nights you stare at the ceiling and

653
00:21:42,760 --> 00:21:45,640
