673
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:20,480
You live in a small house far from any

674
00:22:19,520 --> 00:22:22,200
city.

675
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:24,480
The monitors are gone.

676
00:22:22,200 --> 00:22:26,880
The encrypted channels are silent.

677
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:29,000
The hum of that first old computer is 40

678
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:30,040
